   "titulo": "What hurts is the guy.",
   "texto": [
    "In Portuguese it is said **dói-me a cabeça** (my head hurts): what hurts goes after the verb, as in Spanish.",
    "If it hurts more than one thing, use **doem**: **doem-me os olhos** (my eyes hurt)."
   ]
  },
  {
   "tipo": "explicacion",
   "titulo": "Who hurts",
   "texto": [
    "**dói-me** (it hurts), **dói-te** (it hurts), **dói-lhe** (it hurts, you), **dói-nos** (it hurts). With «lhe» you talk to you or you talk about someone else: **doem-lhe os olhos** (your eyes hurt)."
   ]
